                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "d1ae1d63-62c8-45f3-8acc-68d78d82b6d8",
                        "entry_id": "2968b4f5-db7e-3c6a-a5da-ba5b60ea2a14",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "animaux-garous"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f9d56087-8c03-4eb5-a92a-39946de54bfd",
                        "entry_id": "2968b4f5-db7e-3c6a-a5da-ba5b60ea2a14",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "animal garou"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e8499977-3443-3686-bcb7-36c369599133",
                        "entry_id": "2968b4f5-db7e-3c6a-a5da-ba5b60ea2a14",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Celui qui se transforme d’un être humain en un autre animal et vice versa, de façon complète ou partielle, par exemple un loup-garou."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Fantastique"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "15c323b7-61b9-48ec-b84f-df5f3f4dd236",
                                "sense_id": "e8499977-3443-3686-bcb7-36c369599133",
                                "text": "Les esprits peuvent également s’incarner dans des animaux-garous, le plus souvent malfaisants et impossibles à capturer par des procédés normaux, mais parfois aussi protégeant les récoltes et les troupeaux contre les animaux prédateurs « naturels »."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2fa16e2-496f-4ca5-a94d-2b86dac4d432",
                                "sense_id": "e8499977-3443-3686-bcb7-36c369599133",
                                "text": "Le sorcier est censé agir de diverses manières : par télékinésie ou bilocation, par l’emploi d’animaux-garous, grâce à des poisons ou effluves immatériels."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6be68e14-147f-4bb0-8785-14c3cc1b6352",
                        "source_entry_id": "2968b4f5-db7e-3c6a-a5da-ba5b60ea2a14",
                        "source_sense_id": "e8499977-3443-3686-bcb7-36c369599133",
                        "target_lang_word": "wereanimal",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wereanimal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1c81d6dd-786a-39e7-a368-a461050c2333",
                                        "entry_id": "7a0394ba-f6fd-39e0-8011-cf6f33bd409f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A shapeshifter that can change between human and some animal form, such as a werewolf or werebear."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10fded82-4461-4e10-bead-c9b3eddf1b6f",
                                                "sense_id": "1c81d6dd-786a-39e7-a368-a461050c2333",
                                                "text": "A peculiarity of were-animals is the sympathy that exists between their animal form and that of the human with whom it is connected."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70a41f2a-a75d-4fb4-b251-fda6d30e988d",
                                                "sense_id": "1c81d6dd-786a-39e7-a368-a461050c2333",
                                                "text": "Lysander was speaking to a confused-looking wereanimal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b6ccbd6-2732-450e-8cc8-48776ede8f49",
                                                "sense_id": "1c81d6dd-786a-39e7-a368-a461050c2333",
                                                "text": "His otherworldly energy danced along my skin, and as had happened in New Mexico with a very different wereanimal, it called that piece of Richard's beast that seemed to live inside me. It brought that power in a rush down my skin, ..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f91d886-05c3-43d2-94de-a669be93bf40",
                                                "sense_id": "1c81d6dd-786a-39e7-a368-a461050c2333",
                                                "text": "“You're a fool, Todd. You didn't need anything to protect you,” Muriel said. “Ray was killed by a wereanimal.” “They have the wereanimal that killed Ray locked up. He can't hurt anyone anymore,” she said."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3734b802-b871-41f1-bcde-7bebb1102abf",
                        "source_entry_id": "2968b4f5-db7e-3c6a-a5da-ba5b60ea2a14",
                        "source_sense_id": "e8499977-3443-3686-bcb7-36c369599133",
                        "target_lang_word": "werecreature",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "werecreature",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df78af84-eba3-3aa6-8141-15c685c2441b",
                                        "entry_id": "2f5c5cc5-6f14-3931-ba17-8e491d1348ad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A shapeshifter that can change between human and some animal form, such as a werewolf or werebear."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f82fec59-691d-4d36-a070-0638e7d7e786",
                                                "sense_id": "df78af84-eba3-3aa6-8141-15c685c2441b",
                                                "text": "“We spend months on this. We steal from an archaeological dig, my car smells like coffee, and my great great grandfather's lucky silver dollar has been pounded flat and is now lodged in the right buttock of a were-creature. All so you could key his car?” “Yeah. Wanna hit Burgerphile?”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "06807146-8091-48ea-aafb-1d0407edb59c",
                        "source_entry_id": "2968b4f5-db7e-3c6a-a5da-ba5b60ea2a14",
                        "source_sense_id": "e8499977-3443-3686-bcb7-36c369599133",
                        "target_lang_word": "werebeast",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
